<title>UK: Halk Bank sets 150 million mark five-year bond. [CORRECTED 9:58 gmt]</title>
<headline>Halk Bank sets 150 million mark five-year bond. [CORRECTED 9:58 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers UBS Frankfurt and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TURKIYE HALK BANKASI</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    26.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	+348 BP (corrects from</p>
<p>										    &quot;+350 BP&quot;)</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/TR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  TURKEY    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.50	SELL CONC  0.50	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND DUE JANUARY 2002</p>
<p> NOTES	OWNERSHIP MAINTENANCE CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
